Spec: Stage

ID:
  @SC

Purpose:
  Security validation and approval.

Owns: stages\SC.sdd
Entry:
  RF-XX passed (scoped instance) or CR-XX passed clean
  security requirements known
  applicable skills loaded

Note:
  In the DL1 delivery chain (v2 ordering, Phase 155) scoped SC-XX
  instances run BEFORE the branch's XX-TS — security-defective code
  is never tested first. This generic SC spec governs the unscoped
  stage; scoped instances follow chains/delivery.sdd ordering.

Must:
  run security tests
  validate security requirements
  check for vulnerabilities
  verify auth flows
  review security posture

Exit:
  security tests pass
  no CRITICAL/HIGH findings
  security review approved
  pentest passed (if required)

OnFail:
  classify failure
    security defect -> SC
    code defect -> owner stage
    requirement defect -> AR
  << SC

Next:
  DO
  VR

Review:
  @SC/security-review
  @SC/pentest

Risk:
  R3

Skills:
  @security/threat-model
  @security/sast
  @security/dast
  @security/pentest
  @security/auth

State: +
  
